BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: TorontoBabel Language Exchange
UID:event_317576481@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20261128T073251Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20261205T180000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20261205T230000
SUMMARY:LANGUAGE EVENT SOCIAL: JAPAN NIGHT EPISODE 2 by TorontoBabel
DESCRIPTION:TorontoBabel: Toronto's International Language Exchange\n🌃
 🇯🇵✨ **JAPAN NIGHT EPISODE 2: TOKYO AFTER DARK** ✨🇯🇵\n\nPre
 sented by **Toronto Babel × EventSpace!**\n\nStep into **Tokyo After Dark
 ** for an immersive Japanese-inspired experience filled with glowing paper
  lanterns\, cherry blossoms\, atmospheric lighting\, music\, and culture! 
 Come dressed in your favourite anime cosplay\, neon looks\, kimono-inspire
 d outfits\, or Tokyo street style. 🌸🏮\n\n🌟**WHAT TO EXPECT:**\n\n
 💬 **LANGUAGE EXCHANGE & JAPANESE CULTURE**\nAlongside the performances\
 , come enjoy our regular Toronto Babel language exchange\, featuring a spe
 cial focus on the **Japanese language and culture**! Meet new people\, pra
 ctice languages\, share cultures\, and connect with the local Japanese com
 munity. 🇯🇵🌸\n\n🎭 **ANIME COSPLAY & CONTEST**\nShow off your fa
 vourite anime character or Tokyo-inspired look! We'll be awarding prizes f
 or the **Top 3 costumes**\, so bring your best outfit! 🎎🏆\n\n🎤 **
 J-POP IDOL PERFORMANCES**\n\n🐾 **Paws Arcana (@paws_arcana)**\nGet read
 y for a captivating J-Pop-inspired performance filled with vibrant idol en
 ergy\, catchy music\, and plenty of charm! 💖✨\n\n💃 **Idoloki (@ido
 loki_official)**\nBringing the movement and energy of Japanese idol cultur
 e to the stage\, Idoloki will light things up with dynamic dance routines\
 , synchronized choreography\, and exciting J-Pop dance covers! 🌸🔥\nM
 ore performers will be announced soon\, so stay tuned!\n\n🎧 **DJ F.L.Ÿ
 **\nEnjoy an energetic mix of J-Pop dance music\, anime soundtracks\, and 
 global beats to keep the dance floor moving all night! 🎶🔥\n\n🥁 **
 LIVE JAPANESE TAIKO DRUMMING**\nExperience the powerful rhythms and energy
  of traditional Japanese drumming with **[TBA]**! A performance you'll fee
 l as much as hear! 🥁🇯🇵\n\n🎨 **JAPANESE CALLIGRAPHY ARTIST**\nG
 et your name written in beautiful traditional Japanese brush calligraphy a
 nd take home a unique keepsake! 🖌️🇯🇵\n\n🍸 **JAPANESE-THEMED 
 CRAFT COCKTAILS**\nEnjoy a special cocktail menu featuring Japanese-inspir
 ed flavours and ingredients! 🍑🍵🌿\n\n📅 **Saturday\, December 5\
 , 2026**\n🕕 **6 PM – 10 PM**\n📍 **The Libertine**\n1307 Dundas St 
 W\, Toronto\, ON M6J 1X8\n\n🎟️ **TICKETS & PRICING**\n\n* **Presale: 
 $10** with discount code **KS05**\n* Early Bird: $15 + service fee\n* Gene
 ral Admission: $20 + service fee\n\n🔗 **Get your tickets here:**\n[http
 s://www.event-space.net/event-details/tokyo-after-dark-japan-night-in-toro
 nto](https://www.event-space.net/event-details/tokyo-after-dark-japan-nigh
 t-in-toronto)\n\n💬 **Pull up solo or bring a friend** — meet new peop
 le\, enjoy incredible performances\, and experience a little taste of Toky
 o right here in Toronto! 💬\n\n⚠️ **COMMUNITY & SAFETY**\nToronto Ba
 bel is a language exchange and social community\, not a dating or matchmak
 ing event. Harassment or inappropriate behaviour will not be tolerated. Pl
 ease speak with an organizer if you experience or witness anything concern
 ing.\n\n📸 Photos and videos may be taken during the event for social me
 dia. Please let an organizer know if you prefer not to be photographed.\n\
 n#TorontoBabel #TorontoEvents #TorontoNightlife #Languafe Exchange
